Sval: Remove messaging targeting

ASRouter's targeting environment and the messaging system's Targeting
module evaluated JEXL expressions for Nimbus recipes and for the
targeting snapshot the background update task reads. Sval runs no
Nimbus recipe and never writes the snapshot
(no-messaging-targeting-snapshot.patch), so the snapshot writer goes
with both modules, their metrics and their tests. The messaging
system's Logger stays: Top Sites logs through it.

